{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:40:620","content":{"id":620,"title":"桥和割点","content":[{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"桥"}],"level":2},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"定义"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们首先看一下桥的概念"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_dca603e0-4614-4d7d-8fda-21682a562552.webp","uuid":"bec57360-f0c6-4f5d-9f00-786bc3313917","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_dca603e0-4614-4d7d-8fda-21682a562552.webp","width":340.4166531397242},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面这幅图中，我们称节点 3-5 之间的这条边为桥，它具有什么特点呢? 一旦将这条边去掉，图的联通分量就会发生变化，所以有如下定义："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果去掉某条边，使得图的联通分量发生变化，那么称这条边为桥。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"桥可以看做是图中最脆弱的那条边，如果将交通系统建模为一个图的话，桥就是交通系统中最脆弱的部分，在军事中如果我们知道对方交通系统中的桥，那么我们就可以军事打击这个桥，使得对方的交通系统瘫痪。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"寻找桥"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如何判断某条边是不是桥，对于下图来说， "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0-1","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这条边是桥吗?"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2a875ce4-a170-4bba-85cb-b29a3ea26c43.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2a875ce4-a170-4bba-85cb-b29a3ea26c43.png","width":366.2499854465332},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"答案不是，因为去掉 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0-1","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这条边联通分量的个数没有增加，原因是节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"1","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以通过另一条路径 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"1->3->2->0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 到达 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以我们判断某条边是不是桥，就是判断边的两个节点是否有另外一条路径。考虑边 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"v-w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如果存在另外一条路径，使得节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"v","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以到达节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或者是节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之前的节点，我们就认为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"v-w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不是桥，否则没有另外的路径使得节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"v","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 到达节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，我们就认为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"v-w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是桥。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了完成这个判断，我们需要定义两个变量来帮助我们保存信息，一个是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"order[]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组，它保存的是以 DFS 遍历图的顺序，例如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"order[0] = 0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是第 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个遍历的，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"order[3] = 2","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"3","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是第 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"2","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个遍历的"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/76ab30027ca90366b9dd2c8c55e872eb_e59fe102-f118-4aea-b446-d303f453c95f.gif","uuid":"4c2597a3-1720-4386-9f90-eab3b7b0df1d","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/76ab30027ca90366b9dd2c8c55e872eb_e59fe102-f118-4aea-b446-d303f453c95f.gif","width":601.6666427585823},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另一个需要记录的信息是当前节点通过另外一条路径(即不是父节点那条路径)能够达到的顺序最前的节点，使用数组 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示，假设节点 2 能够达到最前的节点 0，而 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"order[0] = 0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[2] = order[0] = 0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，初始 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[i] = order[i]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，更新 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组有两个时机"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"v","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 访问已被遍历过的邻接节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时(该邻接节点不为父节点)，如果 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[w] < low[v]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，则更新 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[v] = low[w]","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/df30264cc6229d8f7034c30605f95070_009a6380-e51e-4a36-a5a5-b01524f586ce.gif","uuid":"e3b617ff-fa76-41ff-943d-bd356616249e","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/df30264cc6229d8f7034c30605f95070_009a6380-e51e-4a36-a5a5-b01524f586ce.gif","width":601.6666427585823},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们访问到节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"2","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，接着访问节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"2","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的邻接节点，访问到节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不是它的父亲节点(上一个节点)，而且节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 已经被访问过，并且 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[0] < low[2]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以这个时候更新 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[2] = low[0]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"2","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 能通过另一条路径访问第 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[0]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个遍历的节点，即节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"2","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 能够访问到第 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个被遍历的节点，即节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"访问完邻接节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，回到当前节点 v 时，如果邻接节点的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[w] < low[v]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，则更新 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[v] = low[w]","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/df30264cc6229d8f7034c30605f95070%20(1)_427adaa1-786f-4c9e-b217-7790a4e63871.gif","uuid":"fc230633-1282-4c59-ba5f-8a86188f4cf5","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/df30264cc6229d8f7034c30605f95070%20(1)_427adaa1-786f-4c9e-b217-7790a4e63871.gif","width":601.6666427585823},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当节点访问完节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"2","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 回到节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"3","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，此时 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[2] < low[3]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，更新 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[3] = low[2] = 0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，表示 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[3]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以从另外一条路径到达第 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[2] = 0","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个被遍历的节点，即节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0","code":true}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"引入了 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"order","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组，接着我们可以根据这两个数组判断某条边是不是桥了，当我们遍历完相邻节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，来到当前节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"v","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，除了要更新 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[v]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，我们还需要对这条边是不是桥进行判断。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们需要判断 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[w]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"order[v]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的大小，以此判断是否是桥。首先明确一下二者表示的意义："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"low[w]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 能够通过另一条路径能够到达的最前顺序，例如 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[w] = 3","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就表示 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 节点能通过另一条路径到达第 3 个被遍历的节点，"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"order [v]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示节点 v 是第几个被遍历的"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[w] <= order[v]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，说明 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 能通过另一条路径到达节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"v","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"v","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之前被遍历的节点，说明就不是桥，否则就是桥。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"import java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.HashSet;\n\npublic class FindEdge {\n    private int[] order;\n    private int[] low;\n    private Graph graph;\n    private boolean[] visited;\n    private int count = 0;\n\n    // 存储桥\n    private ArrayList<int[]> result;\n\n    public FindEdge(Graph graph) {\n        this.graph = graph;\n        order = new int[graph.V()];\n        low = new int[graph.V()];\n        result = new ArrayList<>();\n        visited = new boolean[graph.V()];\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < graph.V(); i++) {\n            if (!visited[i]) {\n                dfs(i, i);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private void dfs(int v, int parent) {\n        visited[v] = true;\n        low[v] = count;\n        order[v] = count;\n        count++;\n\n        for (int w: graph.adj(v)) {\n            if (!visited[w]) {\n                dfs(w, v);\n                // 更新 low[v] 时机 1\n                low[v] = Math.min(low[v], low[w]);\n                // 判断是否是桥\n                if (low[w] > order[v]) {\n                    result.add(new int[]{v, w});\n                }\n            } else if (w != parent){\n                // 更细 low[v] 时机 2\n                low[v] = Math.min(low[w], low[v]);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    public ArrayList<int[]> getResult() {\n        return result;\n    }\n}","language":"java","uuid":"1877ad2b-56af-44bb-883d-e27f94e5c1d0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"割点"}],"level":2},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"定义"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"割点的定义与桥的定义类似，割点指的是一个节点，如果一旦移除这个节点，会导致图中的联通分量发生变化，那么就称这个节点为割点。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c8a8bf23-0d5a-42c9-95cd-ab0d3bbf1e11.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c8a8bf23-0d5a-42c9-95cd-ab0d3bbf1e11.png","width":343.33331969049294},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上图中节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"3","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"5","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为割点，一旦去掉这两个节点之一，图的联通分量的个数就会发生变化。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"寻找割点"}],"level":3},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"寻找割点的过程同寻找桥是一样的，也需要维护 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"order","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 两个数组，这两数组的含义也是同上一致的。"},{"type":"formatted","text":"low","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组的更新时机以及更新过程也是同上一致的。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在的问题是我们在什么时候判断某节点是不是割点，以及条件是什么。我们在遍历完相邻节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，返回到当前节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"v","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，如果 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[w] >= order[v]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，就说明它是一个割点。这里的判断条件与桥的判断不同，桥的判断条件是如果 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[w] > order[v]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，就说明 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"v-w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这条边是桥，注意多了一个等于号。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"low[w] >=order[v]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"v","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之前被遍历的节点产生连接只能通过节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"v","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_472abf5b-1899-488c-bcc1-a057ec504ee7.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_472abf5b-1899-488c-bcc1-a057ec504ee7.png","width":378.333318299718},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"例如节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"4","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 通过另外一条路径它最多到达节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"5","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，无法与节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"5","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之前被遍历的节点产生连接。一旦节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"5","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 被删除，4 就无法访问到节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"0, 1, 2, 3","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"5","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就是割点。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是添加了等于号之后，这个时候因为任何节点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"low[v] >= order[0]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以根节点 0 会被认为是割点，但根节点不一定是割点，这个时候我们就需要对根节点分别讨论，判断根节点是不是割点很简单，如果通过 DFS 遍历，根节点有两个相邻节点就说明它是割点"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e435b300-8eb6-4de0-88f2-c1222b98a96b.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e435b300-8eb6-4de0-88f2-c1222b98a96b.png","width":719.9999713897716},{"type":"code-block","code":"import java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.HashSet;\n\npublic class FindCutPoints {\n    private Graph graph;\n    private boolean[] visited;\n    private int[] order;\n    private int[] low;\n    private int count = 0;\n\n    private HashSet<Integer> result = new HashSet<>();\n\n    public FindCutPoints(Graph graph) {\n        this.graph = graph;\n\n        visited = new boolean[graph.V()];\n        order = new int[graph.V()];\n        low = new int[graph.V()];\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < graph.V(); i++) {\n            if (!visited[i]) {\n                dfs(i, i);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    private void dfs(int v, int parent) {\n        visited[v] = true;\n        order[v] = count;\n        low[v] = count;\n        count++;\n\n        int child = 0;\n        for (int w: graph.adj(v)) {\n            child++;\n            if (!visited[w]) {\n                dfs(w, v);\n                low[v] = Math.min(low[v], low[w]);\n                if (v != parent && low[w] >= order[v]) {\n                    result.add(v);\n                }\n                if (v == parent && child > 1) {\n                    result.add(v);\n                }\n            } else if (w != parent) {\n                low[v] = Math.min(low[v], low[w]);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    public HashSet<Integer> getResult() {\n        return result;\n    }\n}","language":"java","uuid":"a7e185c0-6c87-4e37-bcc6-14c8a6c422b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"数据结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:593","type":"doc","id":593}},{"label":"图结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:594","type":"doc","id":594}},{"label":"桥和割点","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:620","type":"doc","id":620}}],"prevPage":{"title":"滑动谜题","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:619","type":"doc","id":619}},"nextPage":{"title":"哈密尔顿回路","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:621","type":"doc","id":621}},"createTime":1702052079120,"updateTime":1775929823128,"projectId":40},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1775929823128}}